{"id":"4a2564848c03103c","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-haltseq.md","title":"Halting Sequence","display":"df-haltseq — Halting Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-haltseq","aliases":["90-df-haltseq"],"display":"df-haltseq — Halting Sequence","depends_on":["[[90-df-configuration]]","[[90-df-conf-proj]]","[[90-df-sequence]]","[[90-df-machine-coding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-haltseq"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-haltseq</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-haltseq — Halting Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3953b8fffc6e6551\" href=\"?note=3953b8fffc6e6551\" title=\"90-df-configuration\">90-df-configuration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea8ec37142a5e9b6\" href=\"?note=ea8ec37142a5e9b6\" title=\"90-df-conf-proj\">90-df-conf-proj</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4293e1643a9254d8\" href=\"?note=4293e1643a9254d8\" title=\"90-df-sequence\">90-df-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-haltseq-—-Halting-Sequence-($\\mathrm{HaltSeq}$)\">df-haltseq — Halting Sequence (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HaltSeq}\">\\(\\mathrm{HaltSeq}\\)</span>)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y,e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(y,e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(y)_i\">\\(\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(y)_i\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4293e1643a9254d8\" href=\"?note=4293e1643a9254d8\" title=\"90-df-sequence\">90-df-sequence</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_e,q(e),\\operatorname{CCode},\\operatorname{DecConf}\">\\(M_e,q(e),\\operatorname{CCode},\\operatorname{DecConf}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{State}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{State}_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ea8ec37142a5e9b6\" href=\"?note=ea8ec37142a5e9b6\" title=\"90-df-conf-proj\">90-df-conf-proj</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(j:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LastOK}\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\operatorname{LastOK}\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span> 是下述辅助函数与谓词；整数差只出现在截断表达式中。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nj(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\operatorname{Len}(y)-1,0\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{LastOK}(y,e)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}(y)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(y)&gt;0\\land\\operatorname{CCode}(e,(y)_{j(y)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{LastState}(y,e)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{State}_{M_e}(\\operatorname{DecConf}_e((y)_{j(y)})),&amp;\\operatorname{LastOK}(y,e),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{LastOK}(y,e),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{HaltSeq}(y,e)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}(y)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(y)&gt;0\n\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(y)\\ \\operatorname{CCode}(e,(y)_i)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{6em}\\land\\operatorname{LastState}(y,e)\\in\\{q(e)-2,q(e)-1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nj(y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\operatorname{Len}(y)-1,0\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{LastOK}(y,e)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}(y)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(y)&gt;0\\land\\operatorname{CCode}(e,(y)_{j(y)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{LastState}(y,e)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{State}_{M_e}(\\operatorname{DecConf}_e((y)_{j(y)})),&amp;\\operatorname{LastOK}(y,e),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{LastOK}(y,e),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{HaltSeq}(y,e)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}(y)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(y)&gt;0\n\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(y)\\ \\operatorname{CCode}(e,(y)_i)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{6em}\\land\\operatorname{LastState}(y,e)\\in\\{q(e)-2,q(e)-1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留参数顺序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(y,e)\">\\((y,e)\\)</span>，并保留“合法配置列且末态停机”的原含义；它自身不检查初态或相邻配置的转移。真正的停机计算是此谓词与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CompCode}\">\\(\\operatorname{CompCode}\\)</span> 的合取。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-haltseq-—-Halting-Sequence-($\\mathrm{HaltSeq}$)","text":"df-haltseq — Halting Sequence ($\\mathrm{HaltSeq}$)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"3953b8fffc6e6551","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-configuration]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-conf-proj","status":"resolved","id":"ea8ec37142a5e9b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-conf-proj]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"4293e1643a9254d8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","head